    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, restrained cyan/red palette, crisp cards, and clear headline-to-metric hierarchy across viewports. However, chart polish is below demo-ready: the precision–recall x-axis repeats “100%” and ends at “65%,” dense labels become extremely small on mobile, and the mobile ablation cards feel cramped. The tablet/mobile header visibly clips navigation without a scroll or overflow affordance; mobile also loses the product name and Red Mode action. Contrast proof remains incomplete for numerous header elements.",
